- Lazy-load below-the-fold gallery images; avoid unnecessary lazy-loading of critical above-the-fold content.
- Keep meaningful `alt` text and real image URLs in the markup.
- Verify exact paths, filename capitalization, build output/asset handling, and server configuration if images 404 after lazy loading begins.
